From 8c6e977abb7e788d9fe357471c4a90e49084afbc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 23:17:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Move to an npm workspace: dependency-free core + Vite/Vue web
 app with our own player

- core/: notate, csvmidi, hum, zip, gm, cli and tests, moved from src/ and
  test/; new song.js turns CSV into timed notes (tempo map, bar and beat)
- web/: Vite + Vue editor; same features and storage format as before
  (artifact sync, hum box with history, downloads)
- our own player on Tone.js (synth presets per GM family, synthesized drum
  kit), replacing html-midi-player/Magenta; injectable Tone for tests
- clickable SVG piano roll: click a note to play from it, click anywhere to
  move the playhead, bar numbers, note names on hover
- one self-contained build (vite-plugin-singlefile): no CDN at runtime, so
  the same dist/index.html works from disk and as the claude.ai artifact
- tests: core 28, web player 5
